{"id":19646,"artist":"Lluis Llach","title":"No mes per a tu","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] Midi: Joan Fuentes Pomés\n[00:00.86] Sincro lletra: Daniel's\n[00:02.04] Lluis Llach - No mes per a tu\n[00:04.50] ~~~\n[00:06.65] Amor t' estimo i tant t' estimo\n[00:10.61] Que en l' amor meu ets mesura\n[00:14.57] Tu has obert limits al meu vol\n[00:18.54] Que en serenor declinava\n[00:22.61] I avui em crec prop de la plenitud\n[00:26.57] Nomes perque me la imagines tu\n[00:30.54] Amor t' estima tant tot l' amor meu.\n[00:41.79] I buscaré nomes a tu\n[00:45.43] Amb l' ignorancia de sempre\n[00:49.39] Paraules dites pels amants\n[00:53.14] Desde l' albada dels segles\n[00:57.21] I per engany del meu amor creuré\n[01:01.07] Reinventar el llenguatge a cada gest\n[01:05.03] Engany d' amor i veritat de l' engany\n[01:49.38] Amor d' etern recomençar\n[01:53.02] Qu' empenys la meva aventura\n[01:56.88] Que proa et fas del meu vaixell\n[02:00.42] Quan la mar veus embranzida.\n[02:04.17] En qui allibero antiga esclavitud\n[02:08.13] Per qui confesso aquesta servitud\n[02:11.99] Amor esclau i llibertat de l' amor.\n[02:22.48] Midi/kar: Joan Fuentes&Daniel's\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:00.00] <00:00.00>Midi: Joan Fuentes Pomés\n[00:00.86] <00:00.86>Sincro lletra: Daniel's\n[00:02.04] <00:02.04>Lluis Llach - <00:02.57>No mes per a tu\n[00:04.50] <00:04.50>~~~\n[00:06.64] <00:06.64>A <00:06.96>mor <00:07.18>t' es <00:07.39>ti <00:07.71>mo i <00:07.93>tant <00:08.14>t' es <00:08.36>ti <00:09.32>mo\n[00:10.61] <00:10.61>Que en <00:10.82>l' a <00:11.03>mor <00:11.36>meu <00:11.68>ets <00:12.00>me <00:12.32>su <00:13.50>ra\n[00:14.57] <00:14.57>Tu has <00:15.00>o <00:15.21>bert <00:15.32>li <00:15.64>mits <00:15.86>al <00:16.07>meu <00:16.28>vol\n[00:18.53] <00:18.53>Que en <00:18.75>se <00:19.07>re <00:19.28>nor <00:19.71>de <00:20.03>cli <00:20.35>na <00:21.32>va\n[00:22.60] <00:22.60>I a <00:23.03>vui em <00:23.14>crec <00:23.35>prop <00:23.68>de <00:24.00>l <00:24